{
  "slug": "distill-design",
  "name": "Distill Design",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code plugin recreating the Distill look — tokens, article UI kit, technical diagrams, voice rewrite, and slash commands.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install distill-design@claude-community` from `geo-mena/distill`.\n\nA Claude Skill that codifies the visual and editorial conventions of Distill.pub, the now-archived web-native ML research journal.\n\nClaude Code plugin recreating the Distill look — tokens, article UI kit, technical diagrams, voice rewrite, and slash commands.",
